import subprocess
P="@ULTRON_ROOT@/priest"
STYLE=" Live-action cinematic film, 35mm grain, teal and crimson grading."
S={ # sid: (frames, prompt)  rules: 1 dominant event, <=2 beats, spatial blocking, locked/slow camera, secondary motion, present tense
 "priest":(97,"The priest stands in the burning cathedral ruin and slowly lifts his head, opening his weary eyes toward the camera with quiet fury. Rain falls through the broken roof and embers drift past him, his silver cross swings gently on its chain. The camera holds a steady frame with a very slow push-in."),
 "F1":(97,"The priest on the left follows through his rightward sword swing, the blade still arcing as the pale vampire on the right, headless, stiffens and staggers one step forward while its head dissolves into a rolling cloud of grey ash and glowing red embers. Black blood sprays in a thin arc across the rain, then the vampire's knees buckle and the body collapses onto the wet stone. The priest steps back and flicks the blade down at his side, his long coat swinging. The handheld camera pushes in slowly on the priest, rain streaking diagonally through red light."),
 "S06":(97,"On the left the priest whips his silver sword across in a fast rightward slash, and the leaping vampire on the right is cut through the chest mid-air. The vampire's body splits and bursts outward into glowing red embers and ash that blow past the camera, then the priest strides forward through the cloud, his black coat snapping behind him. He lowers the blade and looks down at the drifting ash. The camera tracks sideways with the swing, handheld, then slows to a gentle push toward his face while rain falls through red light."),
 "F3":(97,"The priest on the left drives a long silver stake into the chest of the pale vampire pinned against the car on the right, both his hands gripping the stake. White-gold light and black blood erupt from the cross-shaped wound, the vampire's mouth opens in a scream and its head snaps back against the car window. The priest holds his ground, his coat and hair blown by the burst of light, then the vampire's face cracks and crumbles into ash. The camera stays locked at medium distance with a slight handheld shake."),
 "F4":(97,"The red-haired hunter on the left fires a silver shotgun point-blank into the chest of the pale vampire on the right, a bright muzzle flash lighting both faces. The vampire's torso blows apart into a spray of glowing ash and embers as its body is thrown backward through the rain. She racks the shotgun and a spent shell tumbles out and falls past the camera. The camera stays locked at medium distance, handheld shake on the shot."),
 "F5":(97,"The priest grips the vampire by the throat with one hand and presses a glowing silver cross against its face with the other. The skin under the cross sizzles and burns away in curls of smoke, the vampire thrashes and screams, its hands clawing at the priest's arm. The priest keeps pressing without flinching, white light flickering across both faces. The camera stays locked in a close medium shot, subtle handheld motion."),
 "F8":(97,"The priest stands in the open cathedral doorway as a pack of vampires charges toward him down the aisle. He steps forward and cuts down the nearest one with a fast silver sword stroke, its body bursting into ash that drifts across the frame. Splinters and dust fly, the huge stained-glass cross glows behind the horde. The camera holds low and still, pushing in very slowly."),
 "F10":(97,"In the foreground the priest, seen from behind, raises his silver sword as Luka lunges from the right, and their blades clash at the center of the frame in a burst of orange sparks flying toward the camera. Luka is forced back one step, and the priest steps forward to keep the blades locked. Colored stained-glass light flickers across their coats. The camera stays locked behind the priest's shoulder, with only slight handheld shake."),
 "S09":(97,"Low angle on the priest holding a glowing silver cross high above his head, and a blinding white-gold light surges outward in a shockwave. The vampires around him recoil, their skin smoking and burning as they cover their faces and stagger backward. Embers and rain swirl in the blast, and the priest's coat and hair blow back. The camera pushes in slowly on his determined face."),
 "S07":(97,"The red-haired hunter on the left aims her crossbow and fires, a glowing white cross bolt streaking across the frame into the snarling vampire on the right. The bolt strikes its chest and a burst of white light blows outward, throwing the vampire backward as ash and sparks fly. Her braid swings from the recoil. The camera stays locked at medium distance, slow motion."),
 "S08":(97,"The huge bearded hunter fires his holy-fire cannon down the alley, and a roaring river of golden-white flame sweeps over the crowd of vampires in front of him. Their bodies ignite and scatter as sparks and burning ash blow back toward the camera. He braces against the recoil with his feet planted, his coat flapping in the heat. The camera stays low and locked."),
 "S11":(97,"The hunters stand back to back in a tight circle, and the vampires charge in from all sides. The priest slashes the nearest one with his silver sword, it bursts into ash, and the hunter beside him fires at the next one, a muzzle flash lighting the group. The camera stays locked at wide framing, rain falling, embers blowing."),
 "S12":(97,"An armored truck with a white cross painted on its hood drives straight toward the camera down the street, its headlights blazing. It smashes through the crowd of vampires, bodies thrown aside on both sides of the bumper as sparks and dust fly. The camera stays low and locked as the truck charges past."),
}
import sys
only = sys.argv[1:] or list(S)
for seed in (711,712):
  for sid in only:
    if sid in ("F1","S06") and seed==711: continue   # lab 'new' takes already exist (seed 701)
    n,pr=S[sid]; out=f"{P}/shots/{sid}_s{seed}.mp4"
    cmd=f'cd @LTX@/ltx-2-mlx-xoc && while ! @ULTRON_ROOT@/tools/heavy_guard.sh >/dev/null; do sleep 15; done; s=$(date +%s); uv run ltx-2-mlx generate --distilled --model @LTX@/pack --prompt "{pr+STYLE}" --image {P}/stills/{sid}_1024.png --height 576 --width 1024 --frames {n} --frame-rate 24 --seed {seed} -o {out} && echo "{sid}_s{seed} done $(( $(date +%s)-s ))s" >> {P}/logs/status2.txt'
    subprocess.run(["zsh","-c",cmd])
